            "description": "Edit a driver's account details and personal information.\n\n**All fields are optional** — send only what you want to change. At least one field is required.\n\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| firstName | string | non-empty |\n| lastName | string | non-empty |\n| email | string | valid email; must not belong to another driver |\n| mobileNumber | string | must not belong to another driver |\n| cityIdentifier | string | `cities.identifier`; must exist |\n| dateOfBirth | string | `YYYY-MM-DD` |\n| gender | string | |\n| homeAddress | string | |\n| nationalIdentificationNumber | string | |\n\nAccount fields and personal information are saved in one database transaction. If the driver has no personal-information record yet, one is created.\n\nStatus (approve/reject) and commission are **not** edited here — use the existing approve, reject and commission endpoints.\n\nRoles: `admin`, `operations`."
          },
